18.55.070:block:14","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","text":"“Ground floor area” means the square foot area of a building within the largest outside dimensions, inclusive of the width of the outside walls but exclusive of open porches, breezeways, terraces, garages, exterior stairways, and secondary stairways.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2b9736c6-a020-5c09-9fa2-95eca95cff41"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","content_hash":"75e5f40a1dedca8289ce8b499ff22a01ef8a039bfe21f4727ea4c7f2c11e0be5","heading":null,"ordinal":15,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:block:15","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","text":"“Group home” means a dwelling occupied by not more than 10 persons, including eight or fewer persons with a disability who need not be related by blood or marriage and not to exceed two staff residents who need not be related by blood or marriage to each other or to the residents of the home, which dwelling is licensed by a regulatory agency of this state. “Group home” does not include “group residence, general” or “group residence, limited.”","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"d678fdbe-21f3-5032-9bfa-42186691dc5e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","content_hash":"96c8534a0848a08044b1d920dc6621125c8ec124a14640985042d65dc8e83817","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","text":"“Group residence, general” means a residential dwelling that is occupied by nine to 15 persons, including more than eight persons each with a disability, none of whom needs to be related by blood or marriage, that is not a “group home” as defined herein.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e5f78e8a-b1cd-5a90-bd96-e0ad729741b9"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","content_hash":"0e4847ecb4bc8942eff90bb54b62bb6d56bd12e883098881d9ac7f4d97fd17e3","heading":null,"ordinal":17,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:block:17","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","text":"“Group residence, limited” means a residential dwelling that is occupied by not more than 10 persons, including a maximum of eight persons each with a disability and a maximum of two staff residents, none of whom needs to be related by blood or marriage, that is not a “group home” as defined herein. (Ord. 19921 § 6, 9-23-14.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"15e3fe7d-dac1-55a9-bc9f-d636c77e6731"},{"attributes":{"legacy_definition_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.55.070:def:garage"},"citation":"18.55.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","content_hash":"093c927d5774f06c3e46328457a512ae49024d4bce08c6417a270be514e41f67","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.070:definition:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.070","text":null,"type":"definition","workbench_component_id":"9e63348c-192e-5783-a825-542f48290d54"},{"attributes":{"legacy_definition_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.55.070:def:garage-attached"},"citation":"18.55.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.m